# Tier 3 (M5): escape-only call/cc stays in tiers 1 and 2 -- no site calls rt_call_cc3, and the
# stack-copying runtime is not linked (spec §9.1 "Stack-copying continuations: some call/cc site
# is tier 3"). Every level: the analysis must not depend on inlining.
all
no rt_call_cc3[(]
has rt_call_cc[(]
nm-no ^_?(rt_call_cc3|core_rewind|core_reenter|core_callcc3_run)$
nm-has ^_?rt_call_cc$
